{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23659","headline":"酬裴相公题兴化小池见招长句 · 白居易","name":"酬裴相公题兴化小池见招长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲爱小塘招散客，不嫌老监与新诗。\n山公倒载无妨学，范蠡扁舟未要追。\n蓬断偶飘桃李径，鸥惊误拂凤皇池。\n敢辞课拙詶高韵，一勺争禁万顷陂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}